{extra}
You can always check the status at:
{link}

Kind regards,
{org}

mail.task.body:
Dear {name},

An expense claim is waiting for you: {action}.

{summary}

Review and handle it in the portal:
{link}

mail.reminder.body:
Dear {name},

These expense claims are still waiting for you:

{list}

Overview: {link}

mail.reminder_submitter.body:
Dear {name},

Your expense claim is still waiting for your details. Please complete them at:
{link}

Kind regards,
{org}

notify.login.body:
Hello {name},

Someone just logged in to {app}.

User: {user}
Time: {when}
IP address: {ip}
Browser: {browser}

Not expected? Change the password of this account.

You receive this notification because it is switched on under Settings → Notifications: {url}/portal/notifications

notify.lockout.body:
Hello {name},

After too many failed login attempts, logging in has been blocked for 15 minutes.

Reason: {reason}
E-mail address: {email}
IP address: {ip}
Time: {when}

The attempts are in the log: {url}/portal/log?tab=failed

You receive this notification because it is switched on under Settings → Notifications: {url}/portal/notifications

notify.mail.body:
Hello {name},

An e-mail arrived in the claims mailbox.

Sender: {sender}
Subject: {subject}
Attachments: {attachments}
Outcome: {outcome} {reference}
Time: {when}

See the log: {url}/portal/log?tab=mails

You receive this notification because it is switched on under Settings → Notifications: {url}/portal/notifications

notify.new_claim.body:
Hello {name},

